ite firm tissue  close to the posterior resection margin  but mobile under the fascia surface  cassette I   In the axillary tail  no lymph node is definitely identified  There is an area of white fibrous white firm tissue  extending along the tail over 6 0cm  and measuring about 0 5cm in diameter  Representative sections of the tissue are submitted in cassette A B  SECTION CODE  C E  edges of the largest biopsy  relation to posterior margin F G  medial and lateral edges of the largest cavity  no inked margin in the samples  H  largest biopsy cavity I J K  posterior margin of the smallest cavity  relation to posterior margin  L M  small biopsy cavity  N O P  distance breast parenchyma  N closest to the small biopsy cavity  inferior  O and P both from deep inferior internal quadrant  Resident  LAURENCE DE LEVAL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  Alphonse Taghian  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Negative.
